1.3 Family members are individuals who are related to a PEP either directly
(consanguinity) or through marriage.

1.4 A family member of the PEP includes the PEP’s:

(a)parents*;

(b)siblings*

(c)spouse;

(d)child*; or

(e)spouse's parents*;

(*) covers both biological and non-biological relationship.
